<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6768500882451372841..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Commissar Avakian&#39;s Evil Ambitions (Updated, May 2) </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>5</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-339192254994609163</id><published>2016-05-03T12:51:55.444-06:00</published><updated>2016-05-03T12:51:55.444-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This is a classic showcase of government being too...</title><content type='html'>This is a classic showcase of government being too large. The trail of destroyed businesses and lives this filthy underclass, public tax feeder seems to have caused has every pot and pan in the house being banged together in a loud waring that government is out of control. But the honest truth is there are a lot of filthy parasites like him, in the many hundreds of thousands running around within this nation doing the same thing. Destroying decent people&amp;#39;s lives. The simple fact is clear, most all government employees are not needed and yet they flock to government employment because they can&amp;#39;t make it in the real world of the private sector. Frankly, I had a hard time reading this story and had to stop a few times because it made me feel sick to know there are no, none, zip safety triggers that can flip to shut down this kind of insane conduct. Not for government employees anyway but let a mother let her children play in the fenced in backyard while she watches from inside the house.  And she could very well get a visit from CPS and threats of taking her children away so the government employees can put them in a home where the kids life will become a living hell. You can&amp;#39;t make this stuff up, because its that out of control. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/339192254994609163'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/339192254994609163'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html?showComment=1462301515444#c339192254994609163' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6768500882451372841' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6768500882451372841' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-676186773"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 3, 2016 at 12:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6156252929860338465</id><published>2016-04-30T10:56:55.510-06:00</published><updated>2016-04-30T10:56:55.510-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Paul, I appreciate your kindness. Do you know, by ...</title><content type='html'>Paul, I appreciate your kindness. Do you know, by any chance, how to contact Chris Penner? I&amp;#39;ve written about what was done to him (here, among other places -- http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/07/first-they-came-for-bar-owners.html) and I&amp;#39;ve had no luck in my efforts to find him. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What &lt;i&gt;really&lt;/i&gt; infuriates me about the Penner case is that he had treated the &amp;quot;Rose City T-Girls&amp;quot; as valued customers, and had hosted all kinds of LGBT events at his club. His only complaint was that the T-Girls were monopolizing his Friday nights: He didn&amp;#39;t tell them to stay away, he asked them to work with him to help prevent the loss of his business, which they also enjoyed. But feelings were hurt, and the &amp;quot;victims&amp;quot; belong to a &amp;quot;specially protected class,&amp;quot; so Comrade Brad destroyed the club and used that accomplishment to rake in huge money from LGBT donors.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The BOLI isn&amp;#39;t a constitutional entity; it was created by the legislature, and can be abolished by it, as well. If this doesn&amp;#39;t happen, somebody &lt;i&gt;really&lt;/i&gt; may have to corner Avakianfor a Bane-style &amp;quot;Day of Reckoning&amp;quot; accountability moment: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rY7stDTWjRI</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/6156252929860338465'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/6156252929860338465'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html?showComment=1462035415510#c6156252929860338465' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6768500882451372841' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6768500882451372841' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 30, 2016 at 10:56 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1791806846894288806</id><published>2016-04-30T10:37:53.922-06:00</published><updated>2016-04-30T10:37:53.922-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This doesn&amp;#39;t even begin to describe the harm t...</title><content type='html'>This doesn&amp;#39;t even begin to describe the harm this guy has done to Oregon businesses. Although I&amp;#39;m sure you have much more going on than this and you could write a book about this guy&amp;#39;s misbehaving&amp;#39;s.  &lt;br /&gt;There was another instance where he basically handed a bar over to a group of transvestites in the form of a $400,000 fine for asking them not to come back after they turned the bar into their own little club and chased all the other patrons away.  Funny that they weren&amp;#39;t even gay.&lt;br /&gt;The bar owner is now bartending for someone else and living with roommates (I think his mom) after being a property tax payer that actually paid the salary of this politico.   Avakian literally ruined an honest man&amp;#39;s life.&lt;br /&gt;Thank you for posting this stuff on your site!&lt;br /&gt;You do important work.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/1791806846894288806'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/1791806846894288806'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html?showComment=1462034273922#c1791806846894288806' title=''/><author><name>Paul</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6768500882451372841' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6768500882451372841' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-576949673"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 30, 2016 at 10:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3721320882520619380</id><published>2016-04-30T04:57:00.500-06:00</published><updated>2016-04-30T04:57:00.500-06:00</updated><title type='text'>San Diego used to see many shops with signs &amp;#39;n...</title><content type='html'>San Diego used to see many shops with signs &amp;#39;no dogs or sailors&amp;#39;, no big deal back in the day but a huge deal if it occurred in the present era of faux patriotism. Montana, until recently (perhaps still does, I haven&amp;#39;t been home in over eight years) saw &amp;#39;no shoes, no shirt, no service&amp;#39; or what could amount to an invitation for the &amp;#39;femen&amp;#39; to sue. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Personally, I find Christian proselytizing highly offensive, where an entire social strata holds itself superior to those &amp;#39;not saved&amp;#39; and I can be badgered by smug hypocrites at my door with the idea I&amp;#39;m &amp;#39;born dirty&amp;#39; (in sin) and will be judged accordingly by a god the comedian Lewis Black has described as necessary to keep an ancient culture in line that was behaviorally &amp;quot;ten hairs from being baboons.&amp;quot; Shouldn&amp;#39;t that put me in a protected class to shield my sensitivities? It&amp;#39;ll never happen. What we see here (in the present article) amounts to little more than some petty bureaucrat pushing gay evangelism, so what if the shop keepers wanted nothing to do with it? Why should they be held more accountable than the numerous persons (myself included) who&amp;#39;ve told countless Mormons, Jehovah&amp;#39;s Witnesses and generic other Christians to &amp;quot;go away.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A related aside,  if there were an actual wall between church &amp;amp; state, the contract law aspect of marriage would be limited to strictly civil unions regardless of faith or orientation and the religious aspect a matter solely between the parties to the marriage and their preferred church or philosophical community, or lack thereof, without government sanction.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/3721320882520619380'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/3721320882520619380'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html?showComment=1462013820500#c3721320882520619380' title=''/><author><name>Ronald Thomas West</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16534265281470163729</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//1.bp.blogspot.com/-heL0XqrHVXg/T2ZX1WHX3fI/AAAAAAAAACw/aFV2-C4SvmQ/s220/Ron10.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/04/commissar-avakians-evil-ambitions.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6768500882451372841' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6768500882451372841' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1253045760"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 30, 2016 at 4:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7755847658461302080</id><published>2016-04-29T10:05:36.970-06:00</published><updated>2016-04-29T10:05:36.970-06:00</updated><title type='text'>give a human being a little power and - VOILA!! - ...</title><content type='html'>give a human being a little power and - VOILA!! - an aggressive, objectionable, disgusting, hateful, mean spirited, authoritarian prick results.  avarkian (small letter intended) is the personification of this timeless fact, which will never change.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the real question:  why can&amp;#39;t humanity learn this timeless fact, realize govt is the only entity that bestows such power and results in such actions as those featured and is the CAUSE, not the ANSWER, to most of humanity&amp;#39;s catastrophes?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/default/7755847658461302080'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6768500882451372841/comments/de